YBoldReleaseScriptsTest (serialized environment-owning fixture)
├── deployment authority or chain has changed
│   └── it should abort before creating contracts
├── deployment proxy configuration differs from the reviewed release
│   └── it should reject the mismatched code, role, implementation, or slippage
├── treasury custody or manager snapshot has drifted
│   └── it should reject stale expectations
└── upgrade calldata is prepared
    ├── current and next code and Safe authority match
    │   └── it should return only unsigned calldata and leave implementation unchanged
    └── a code hash or implementation expectation differs
        └── it should abort
